{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764475,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"The Innovation Auction ","festival_id":null,"organization_id":652294,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-16T15:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/the-innovation-auction-shaheed-rajguru-college-of-applied-sciences-for-women-delhi-university-1764475","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>About the Competition<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<p>Innovation Auction is a two-round entrepreneurship and strategy competition that tests innovation, strategic thinking, adaptability and resource management. Teams build a business idea around a given problem, bid for resources such as AI technology, funding, sustainable production, expert consultation and marketing support, then adapt their idea and pitch it to the judges.<\/p>\n<p>*Build your idea. Bid for your resources. Adapt your strategy. Make it work.*<br \/>Plan &rarr; Bid &rarr; Adapt &rarr; Innovate &rarr; Solve<\/p>\n<p><strong>General Guidelines<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<p>- Register through Unstop before the deadline.<br \/>- Teams must have 2&ndash;3 members.<br \/>- Only shortlisted teams from Round 1 proceed to the final round.<br \/>- Plagiarism or unfair practices will lead to immediate disqualification.<br \/>- Follow the instructions given by the organising committee.<\/p>\n<p><strong>JOIN THE OFFICIAL WHATSAPP GROUP FOR UPDATES!<\/strong><br \/>https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/BrS5MFmMCAAEKFGn5fPJMt?mode=gi_t<\/p>\n<p><br \/><strong>Eligibility<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<p>- Open to undergraduate and postgraduate students from all colleges and universities.<br \/>- Inter-college teams are allowed.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- Adhere strictly to the time limits during presentations.<br \/>- Unfair means during the online quiz will result in disqualification.<br \/>- Ensure stable internet connectivity during the online quiz.<br \/>- Late submissions or incomplete registrations will not be considered.<br \/>- The decision of the judges and organising committee is final and binding.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Time Structure<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Preparation Time: 10&ndash;15 minutes<br \/>Presentation Time: 4&ndash;5 minutes per team<br \/>Judges' Questions: 2&ndash;3 minutes<\/p>\n<p><strong>Judging <\/strong><strong>Criteria<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>- *Resource Utilisation:* Effective use of acquired resources<br \/>- *Adaptability:* Modifying the idea to fit available resources<br \/>- *Problem-Solving:* How well the solution addresses the problem<br \/>- *Innovation:* Creativity within resource limits<br \/>- *Strategic Decision-Making:* Smart bidding and resource allocation<br \/>- *Business Viability:* Practicality and feasibility of the model<br \/>- *Presentation &amp; Justification:* Clear, convincing explanation of decisions and solution<\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":8817575,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T19:19:23+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-03T20:28:12+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"KmM1EBA","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":19,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-10-01 19:37:59","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"auto_send_participation_certificate":true,"close